                Properties: create, query, edit
        priorityH (Queryable[int]?): Specifies the priority of the ikHandle.  
                C: The default is on.  
                Q: When queried, this flag returns an int.  
                Properties: create, query, edit
        scaleCompensateJ (bool?): Specifies if scale compensate is enabled.  
                C: The default is on.  
