                Properties: query, edit
        phaseZ (Queryable[float]?): Z component of phase shift of turbulence field. This influences  
                the direction of the disruption.  
                Properties: query, edit
        position (Queryable[Multiuse[Tuple[float, float, float]]]?): Position in space (x,y,z) where you want to place a gravity field.  
